# Org structure (mandatory)

**Structure truth:** [`docs/ORG-BLUEPRINT.md`](docs/ORG-BLUEPRINT.md). **Work queue:** [`ORG-BACKLOG.md`](ORG-BACKLOG.md). Read the blueprint before adding chrome, theme, nav, or layout files.

- **One document shell:** `BaseDocument` → `SiteLayout` / `LabLayout`. Do not revive a second full `Layout.astro` or duplicate html/head/theme bootstrap.
- **CSS:** production pages import only `src/styles/production/`. Lab CSS under `src/styles/lab/` is imported only by `LabLayout`. Never ship lab persona/chaos matrix CSS on production routes (playground gets curated `playground-presets.css` only).
- **Nav:** single source `src/lib/nav.ts` — no second primary-nav list. About/Writing stay off primary nav.
- **Home:** diverge lab vs production by props/flags (`HomeContent variant`), not forked `HomeContent`/layout shells.
- **Appearance:** playground only (see product-invariants).
- **Before adding files:** extend existing paths — do not re-split the repo.
